{"case_id":"kq-039","case_sha256":"47ea4c9ed26aca7bd0b6f81d2c1816e1c4abf95f39e21f044352365b58c5c5c2","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026"],"answer":"**不是立即享受。** 按2026年学生医保须知，集中参保期外未购买的学生，需先由学院统一收集姓名、学号、身份证号、电话和缴费金额，发校医院医保办完成参保登记，再按医保办后续通知缴费。\n\n**待遇起算：** 待遇自缴费之日起90天后（不含第90天）才能享受，所以办理登记和完成缴费是起算前提。\n\n**校区与时效：** 宜宾校区按宜宾市当地政策执行；该须知可能已过期，请以最新通知为准。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":9362.825499996688,"cost_usd":0.003353184,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-112","case_sha256":"051dd4ff9d1cbccd23000a658d3b7c8bd5cb182a497a2e65311b566d9046189f","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1042:guide-body","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1042:flow-image","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:43","cdut:chunk:psych2026:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1042:guide-body","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1042:flow-image","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:43","cdut:chunk:psych2026:bs01"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:evidence:bsdt-1042","cdut:source:official:portal-1042","cdut:source:psych-fall-2026"],"answer":"不能。**证据情况：** 该事项指南正文的“办理流程”只写到“1.如下：”，“其它说明”是“暂无”，尚未核验完整步骤，也无法生成准备清单，所以“文字1”这段不能当成完整咨询流程。另有一张流程图截图，列出电脑端和手机端两种进入方式，但未标日期，使用前要核对系统是否可用。\n\n**已证实部分：** 2026年秋季学期通知写明：在校园网区域内进入“砚湖易办”，点击事务中心板块“心理咨询预约”，并按预约时间前往心理中心；也可直接到心理健康教育中心现场预约。成都校区在芙蓉餐厅三楼，宜宾校区在二期食堂三楼；电话028-84075525。\n\n**仍未知：** 材料清单、表单字段、改约规则等指南未收录，无法确认。\n\n**建议：** 先按最新学期通知的渠道预约；若需要材料细节，再向心理健康教育中心确认。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":8642.384099999617,"cost_usd":0.003858906,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-037","case_sha256":"b876b18a54c3c009989a65627e37d37e55811ba2ee30cd3595ef239fbc680003","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:wx:fee20262027:03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:wx:fee20262027:03","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:medins2026"],"answer":"**不是免除：** 助学贷款与医保缴费是两件事。办理助学贷款的学生如参加2026年成都大学生医保，仍需自行按学校财务处公布的方式缴费；医保为自愿参保，不参加可以不缴，但无法享受相应待遇。\n\n**时间前提：** 2026年集中参保缴费原则上截至2025年12月20日左右，现已过期；逾期未办视为放弃，医疗费用全额自费。若仍需参加，需由学院收集姓名、学号、身份证号、电话和缴费金额交校医院医保办登记，再按通知缴费，自缴费之日起90天后享受待遇。该资料可能已过期，请以最新通知为准；宜宾校区按当地政策执行。\n\n**下一步：** 可先向学院资助老师或校医院医保办确认当前补办安排。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":9833.333399998082,"cost_usd":0.003595578,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-076","case_sha256":"deef5fe59602111d83bf6008d99be00c893c161292aa4f8c1166f97812f6fb59","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:21"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:21"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-1053"],"answer":"**两处写法：**“保修”是流程图原图中的字样，采集核对时按原图保留，并非另一个事项；正文事项名是“网络故障报修”，正式名称应以“报修”为准。\n\n**办理路径：**按正文内容操作：登录“砚湖易办”，进入“事务中心”，选择网络与信息化处；提交报修单后，经审批通过再维修。该指南目前仅确认适用于本科生、研究生，适用校区尚未确认；入口当前可访问性也未核验。\n\n**建议：**填单时按页面实际选项选择“网络故障报修”，不要因为图片写“保修”而另找事项。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":6175.281200001336,"cost_usd":0.00276714,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-079","case_sha256":"a067630b238dce0b35e6f994163c89f3b48811e52b305567c6e2704ec7da0d1b","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:official:netcarrier2025:counter-service"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:official:netcarrier2025:counter-service"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-1053"],"answer":"这份指南明确列出的办理方式是“线上办理”，无法确认是否另有线下受理。没有列出线下渠道不能排除其他受理安排；请按已列的线上渠道办理，如需现场提交，先向该事项主管部门核实。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":2538.516900000104,"cost_usd":0.0005076,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-011","case_sha256":"67ebdc986a202cdea2445baf8e497103304acd190d463b3118d6c895a2525f3e","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:01","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs02","cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:transfer2026:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:01","cdut:chunk:select20262027:bs01","cdut:chunk:pubelective20262027:bs02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"**咨询科室：** 本科选课和课表问题应向教务处教学事务中心咨询。\n\n该中心负责本科课表与选课、考试组织、学生成绩管理、课程重修等事务，科室页面所列地点为办公楼109室，电话为028-84079520。\n\n**关键提醒：** 上述地址与电话仍需现时复核；该来源的适用校区尚未确认。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":6361.947399997007,"cost_usd":0.002152626,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-012","case_sha256":"2c887ea7b29170c95bfb4afb902cb443011e5535fadbdc7adf369d78fe111e49","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:02","cdut:candidate-office:06","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:15","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:16"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:candidate-office:06","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:02","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:15","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:16"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"**职责归属：** 本科学籍与学位资格审核由教务处学籍管理科负责，具体包括本科学籍、学历注册、毕业和学位资格审核等事项。\n\n**联系方式：** 资料记载地点为办公楼110室，公开电话028-84078882；但该地点和电话尚需独立核对，当前有效性也待确认。该资料适用校区尚未确认，建议办理前先向学籍管理科核实。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":4135.6788000011875,"cost_usd":0.001987584,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-013","case_sha256":"73c4792d09e4d3ae384ae90497d470e669bcf6a41b65d5c7923fe22b5991fe50","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:03","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:05","cdut:candidate-office:03","cdut:chunk:xscoffices:05","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:01","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:06"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:candidate-office:03","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:05"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"**归口部门：**教务处教材建设科负责教材管理、选用审核以及征订与发放等工作。\n\n**联系方式：**现有资料中，该科列出的地点为办公楼106室、6B107-2，电话为028-84078905、028-84079924。这些地点和电话来自官网科室设置，办理前最好再核对一次。\n\n**注意：**资料没有写明这些信息适用于哪个校区，所以不能直接认定它在各校区都通用；如果是为某门课程征订教材，建议先联系教材建设科确认具体流程。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":6177.583500000765,"cost_usd":0.002674602,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-014","case_sha256":"2a8013001470c0e1a25715556bcfb1958dea6211a0755e285ad3906692fcd5dd","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:06","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:30","cdut:candidate-office:04","cdut:chunk:xscoffices:02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:06","cdut:candidate-office:04"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"**负责科室：** 本科毕业设计（论文）和大学生竞赛事务由教务处实践教学科负责，该科室也承担实践教学、实验项目等工作。\n\n**地点与电话：** 资料记载的办公室是办公楼107室，公开电话为028-84078931；不过这两项信息还需要独立核对，来源未确认适用于哪个校区，因此不能推定为全校通用。\n\n**建议：** 前往办理前，可以先通过电话确认办公时间和具体经办人。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":4477.870899998379,"cost_usd":0.00125217,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-015","case_sha256":"58789ffd07880c2dbc1a19ebe49dd0edc5c85c96eb4f14101e2f79df5ee6d620","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:aaooffices:04","cdut:candidate-office:02","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:03","cdut:chunk:xjgl2019:04"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:candidate-office:02","cdut:chunk:aaooffices:04"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:aaooffices"],"answer":"**承担科室：**教务处质量建设与智慧教学科，负责本科培养方案、专业建设、课程建设与教改等工作。\n\n**联系信息：**资料记载该科位于办公楼105室，电话028-84078883；但来源注明地点和电话需独立核对，且适用校区尚未确认。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5409.908300000097,"cost_usd":0.00141831,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-016","case_sha256":"2bdee8918a255b71dd05376b5ba301f78404a3af9e8134563d470339a0fa5792","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs16","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:medins2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs16"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:freshman-guide-2026","cdut:source:medins2026"],"answer":"**分类表述：**校医院被列为“校内非营利性公立医院”，同时明确为“大学生医保首诊医院”。\n\n**资料范围：**这一表述见于2026年新生入学须知，适用范围标注为本科生；其他届别或校区的同类介绍，资料未作说明。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5103.298000001814,"cost_usd":0.00254409,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-017","case_sha256":"419c32a93e839a0aaca74a52f1d7811e2d78859e93f475ece20fbb90ad9a38b8","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs15","cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs01","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:24","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:hospoverview","cdut:source:freshman-guide-2026"],"answer":"**设有：**成都理工大学医院（校医院）的科室设置中明确列有“口腔科”和“检验科”，并配有口腔诊疗中心及检验相关设备。\n\n**服务时间：**口腔科提供工作日午间及周末延时服务；检验科的具体开放时段，现有资料没有单独列出。以上依据的是医院概况及2026年新生入学须知。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":7432.189800001652,"cost_usd":0.0030243,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-018","case_sha256":"c6549e2e0796511fca4c4032f49e89993d5b137df694195cd3f42f921c6a1691","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:expand-canteen:01","cdut:chunk:expand-schedule:02","cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:14"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:hospoverview"],"answer":"**包含。** 医院简介的“放射科”项目中列有“全身各部位数字化摄影 DR 检查、CT检查”，此外还有口腔全景牙摄影 DR 检查。\n\n**说明：** 该清单统计截至 2026 年 2 月，资料未注明适用的具体校区，实际能否做 CT 请以医院现场安排为准。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5043.6248000005435,"cost_usd":0.001463214,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-019","case_sha256":"04da193cfdc0c731ce4a79b6eccfa8da7dd26b7d32d243edf72a8a69d1dd7c53","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02","cdut:chunk:cistwork2025:bs01","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2025:bs15","cdut:chunk:cistfresh2024:bs16"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:hospoverview:bs02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:hospoverview"],"answer":"**处理方式：** 校医院检验科与第三方检测机构长期合作；对本院不能自行开展的实验室检测项目，医院会把标本外送检测。\n\n**范围说明：** 该信息来自医院概况（统计截至2026年2月），现有资料未注明适用校区；具体外送项目、送检流程和费用均未提及，无法确认。\n\n**下一步：** 可先向校医院检验科确认拟做项目是否属于外送范围。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":6541.953200001444,"cost_usd":0.001793226,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
