{"case_id":"kq-072","case_sha256":"1ffb33e700f4dff8a110b21b8da13d4d0dd49629406f3cef5311dd7a8cf39c89","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:01","cdut:chunk:card2024:02","cdut:chunk:netfaq2023:01","cdut:chunk:expand-card:01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:01","cdut:chunk:expand-card:01","cdut:chunk:card2024:02"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:card2024"],"answer":"**账号密码：** 学生版指南（2024年8月第四版）写明，“成理校园卡”微信小程序通过统一登录绑定，账号为学工号，密码为砚湖易办密码。\n\n**办理前：** 这份资料尚未确认适用校区，建议在正式绑定前复核现行入口和流程。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":6633.269100002508,"cost_usd":0.001907214,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-073","case_sha256":"8eb371106536bd5685759925e6cd3b4923423672ef99fcf01233348a2884b171","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:02","cdut:chunk:expand-card:01","cdut:chunk:card2024:01","cdut:chunk:expand-card:02"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:expand-card:01","cdut:chunk:card2024:02","cdut:chunk:card2024:01"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:card2024"],"answer":"**有说明：**《成都理工大学网络与信息化服务指南（学生版）》第四版（2024年8月）的校园卡服务章节明确写明可以挂失和办理解挂，并给出两种渠道：自助补卡设备上操作，或通过“成理校园卡”微信小程序办理。指南也提醒，校园卡丢失后应立即挂失。\n\n**操作要点：**在自助设备上挂失，需要输入卡号和密码；解挂时需刷卡或输入学工号，并输入密码和身份证号。使用小程序时，需要输入证件号和消费密码。\n\n**关键提醒：**上述内容属于2024年版本，可能已经过期，请以最新通知为准，正式办理前先复核现行入口；该资料中涉及的适用校区尚未确认。\n\n（注：所引用的部分资料可能已过期，请以学校最新通知为准。）","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":6640.374799997517,"cost_usd":0.001856502,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-074","case_sha256":"9b1287f125163a97871803ec480582a7212114a8f12d8e7897829556364be331","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:03","cdut:chunk:official:graduate-proof-2023:frequency","cdut:chunk:expand-card:01","cdut:chunk:card2024:01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:03","cdut:chunk:official:graduate-proof-2023:frequency","cdut:chunk:expand-card:01","cdut:chunk:card2024:01"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:evidence:campus-plan","cdut:evidence:card-counter-2019","cdut:evidence:card-guide-2024","cdut:evidence:card-operation-2020","cdut:evidence:card-replacement-guide-2024","cdut:evidence:card-self-service-2023"],"answer":"已确认的部分信息：\n**去哪办：**珙桐、银杏、香樟食堂自助服务区；机器按支持卡种使用。\n**办理前：**带本人身份证，卡内余额须**大于20元**（余额要求，不是补卡费）。\n**怎么做：**遗失先在「成理校园卡」小程序挂失 → 自助机「自助补卡」→ 按提示验证、缴费、领卡。\n**人工办理：**财务处楼校园一卡通中心，去前拨028-84078750确认时间。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":7555.673399998341,"cost_usd":0.00427755,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-075","case_sha256":"a41fa775a18d3c7af2995ceda75040ea675a148fc5c143de24433f1f3f2ccc95","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:02","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:expand-card:02","cdut:chunk:expand-card:03"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:card2024:02","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:expand-card:02","cdut:chunk:expand-card:03"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:card2024","cdut:source:portal-service-guide"],"answer":"不能保证。2024年8月第四版学生版指南只列了校园卡小程序挂失、解挂、查询消费流水等功能，并明确写明“正式办理前应复核现行入口”，即它反映的是2024年版本信息，不能证明现在的入口没有变化；同一指南也未列补卡机具体位置和工本费，办理时应以校园卡中心最新公告或设备提示为准。该指南来源的适用校区尚未确认，需要根据你所在校区的现行通知核对。\n\n**线上核对：**在砚湖易办“办事指南”中按事项类型、服务对象筛选“网络与信息化服务指南（学生版）”等条目，具体入口以服务详情页为准。\n\n**线下核对：**以校园卡中心最新公告和自助补卡机的设备提示为准。","behavior":"partial","latency_ms":7133.861199999956,"cost_usd":0.002679822,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-077","case_sha256":"eb2e4adb51dfae678ecab1791b72c0c486fd932775223375529f39b0ee4ca9f9","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:expand-card:06"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:evidence:bsdt-1053","cdut:source:official:portal-1053"],"answer":"**先进入：**登录“砚湖易办”后，先进入“事务中心”，再选择“网络与信息化处”，填写《网络故障报修》并提交审批；审批通过后维修。流程图中写的是“保修”，事项正文名称为“报修”。\n\n**适用范围：**该流程说明仅适用于本科生、研究生，来源适用校区尚未确认，也未收录登录后的完整页面操作。\n\n**入口：**可点击下方“网络故障报修”办理指南；该入口当前是否可访问、能否完成办理，尚未核验，不代表事项当前开放。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5726.141499999358,"cost_usd":0.002513952,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-078","case_sha256":"d056b6c5157adb68b86c6101aef614968421afb4d718675bdff4647ac8c0ecb5","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39","cdut:chunk:official:netcarrier2025:counter-service"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:evidence:bsdt-1053","cdut:source:official:portal-1053"],"answer":"**不是。**提交只表示发起申请，随后仍需网络与信息化处经办人审核，审批通过后才安排维修；办结后还需申请人查看审核结果并确认结果。\n\n**入口：**线上在砚湖易办「事务中心」选择网络与信息化处，填写《网络故障报修》提交（原图写作“保修”）。流程图为学生适用，校区范围未确认；咨询电话 028-84079467。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":5938.0765999994765,"cost_usd":0.002515398,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-080","case_sha256":"0f697683656c2faebfa451eb980afb5b1eec71bae231207f4d902a4f384038cb","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:mee2025grant:bs05","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:checked-flow","cdut:chunk:official:portal-1053:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:39"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:evidence:bsdt-1053","cdut:source:official:portal-1053"],"answer":"由**网络与信息化处**处理。\n\n流程上，申请提交后进入审核环节，由网络与信息化处的经办人审核，审批通过后再维修。线上办理路径为：登录砚湖易办，进入“事务中心”，选择网络与信息化处，填写申请表并提交。\n\n**提醒：** 图片中的“保修”按原图保留，正式事项名为“网络故障报修”；公开资料标注服务人群为研究生、学校管理员、教师、学生，适用校区尚未确认。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":7653.384299999743,"cost_usd":0.00279144,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-091","case_sha256":"847dbee26586e29dd3806efabf7c728fa29295df06c3adeeeee7ad47504ff67b","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs04"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs02","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs01","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs03","cdut:chunk:loanconfirm2026:bs04"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:loanconfirm2026"],"answer":"已知经办银行是国开行。请先确认你的毕业届次。当前取得的是2026届贷款毕业确认通知，不能直接当作你当前适用的流程。确认后请从经办银行官方渠道或资助管理中心核对现行手续；收到短信时先核实来源。","behavior":"clarify","latency_ms":2040.420900000754,"cost_usd":0.0003723,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
