{"case_id":"kq-096","case_sha256":"a7cb7b9ae65f3f95fae975c358f5976e1cc0cf3cce8306bb156d621c6d4fa2fa","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-4","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-3","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:guide-body"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:guide-body","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-3","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-4"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-06"],"answer":"**准备信息：**从迎新网“在线报到”选择“激活账号”，准备本人姓名、证件号码（须与系统记录一致）及可接收短信的手机号。\n\n**安全手机：**填写本人手机号；安全手机是以后找回密码的依据，不要填家长或他人的号码。\n\n**后续设置：**收到并验证手机号后设置密码，密码须含大小写字母和数字、不少于8位，页面显示激活成功后才可用。指南适用本科、研究生新生，未注明校区；账号问题可咨询网络与信息化处028-84079530。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":11211.853200002224,"cost_usd":0.003541566,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
