{"case_id":"kq-098","case_sha256":"de0abd16dc37a673e1b3e78ac2c5846fd3e1366abc98a4c44aaafd30931f4a7b","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-3","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5","cdut:chunk:wx:fresh2026fee:01"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-3","cdut:chunk:wx:fresh2026fee:01","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-5"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:portal-service-guide","cdut:source:official:portal-06"],"answer":"不是输入姓名和证件号码就直接成功。核验信息一致后，还要绑定安全手机（用于以后找回密码，需使用本人手机号）、获取短信验证码，并设置密码；密码须包含大小写字母和数字，至少8位（图示写8—20位，实际以激活页面校验为准），页面显示激活成功后，才可用账号访问学校系统。\n\n**适用范围：** 本科、研究生新生均适用，校区尚未确认；账号问题可咨询网络与信息化处028-84079530。可点击下方办事入口查看激活指南；该入口当前是否可访问未核验。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":8862.940700000763,"cost_usd":0.002930634,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
{"case_id":"kq-099","case_sha256":"d30fe2afce92dadc9e0c7c2e9a7e263aa5eaf28d50bc30c8e2f9dcbbb4ddd786","knowledge_version":"kb-1d15bf97b31c0d90","ranked_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-4","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:44","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38"],"shown_chunk_ids":["cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:guide-body","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:38","cdut:chunk:official:portal-06:checked-step-4","cdut:chunk:fresh2026:44"],"cited_source_ids":["cdut:source:official:portal-06"],"answer":"**下一步：**收到短信验证码后，填入验证码并点“下一步”，进入设置密码；新密码须同时包含大小写字母和数字，长度不少于8位。\n\n**完成标志：**页面显示“激活成功”后，即可用该账号访问学校系统。安全手机是你以后找回密码的依据，务必使用本人手机号；账号问题可咨询网络与信息化处 028-84079530。该说明适用于本科生、研究生新生，具体适用校区尚未确认。\n\n**办理指南：**可在下方办事入口查看《新生统一身份认证账号激活说明》，其当前可访问性未核实。","behavior":"answer","latency_ms":9117.805099998805,"cost_usd":0.003190278,"execution_mode":"real_agent_lexical_jev_on"}
